      // F-655: ASK THE GUEST'S OWN ENUMERATED TOC. This replaces F-654's
      // `blocked=HOST-TOC-IS-AES` with the thing that is actually true: the
      // host's ON-DISK TOC is AES, and the guest's IN-MEMORY one is not, and the
